 ADR 0077 — Pattern quality + intervention audit
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 Builds the pattern population (autonomous_pass sizes 2-5)
 then runs pattern_quality_report + recommend_pattern_
 intervention on each. Cross-substrate validation uses
 imagined substrates generated from each theory.

